# The state is a build artifact and is never committed.
#
# **A committed snapshot is a number nobody checked.** The first deployment of the page
# this one is a view of published last month's test count for exactly that reason, and
# every step of the build reported success while it happened. The page is built from
# what a run read, so the file that records what a run read is not source.
src/state/

# A checkout of each project a run reads, and everything inside it.
build/

node_modules/
dist/
.astro/

# macOS
.DS_Store
